CRS representations you can work with in R
proj_crs_text() converts between CRS representations. The format argument selects the output:

format = 0L → WKT2 (the default, most expressive)
format = 1L → proj-string
format = 2L → PROJJSON

library(PROJ)

## WKT2
cat(proj_crs_text("EPSG:4326", format = 0L))
